1 0 obj<</Author(TechnoSkittles)/CreationDate(D:20261101010553+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Razz \(She-Ra\), He-Man | Adam, Original Characters, Mara \(She-Ra\), the cliche family au we've all been waiting for, and by that I mean I legit haven't found one and I'm APPALLED, family au, Alternate Universe - Modern Setting, Alternate Universe - Family, we're bringing in all the cliche tropes here, Fluff, Fluff and Angst, still figuring out some things here and there, so will add more tags and characters as I figure out where they fit into the story, Mara is Adora's daughter in this AU, F/F, No Archive Warnings Apply, Lonnie \(She-Ra\), Entrapta \(She-Ra\), Alcohol, Catra is Puerto Rican in this AU, In fact it's safe to assume she'll be Puerto Rican in almost any AU I do, unless I say otherwise, Glimmer is Filipino, He-Man | Adam/Glimmer \(She-Ra\), side relationship - Relationship, Perfuma \(She-Ra\), Mermista \(She-Ra\), Sea Hawk \(She-Ra\), Teen And Up Audiences, slowburn, Mermista/Sea Hawk \(She-Ra\), Frosta \(She-Ra\), Double Trouble \(She-Ra\), Light Hope \(She-Ra\), Rogelio \(She-Ra\), Kyle \(She-Ra\), Spinnerella \(She-Ra\), Netossa \(She-Ra\), Marlena \(He-Man\), Randor \(He-Man\), Man-At-Arms \(He-Man\))/ModDate(D:20261101010553+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Pure Feeling)>>
